      "lines": [
        "例2　化简分式$\\frac{x^2-3}{x+\\sqrt{3}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "将分式的分子写成平方差的形式："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x^2-3=x^2-(\\sqrt{3})^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{x^2-3}{x+\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{x^2-(\\sqrt{3})^2}{x+\\sqrt{3}}↵=\\frac{(x+\\sqrt{3})(x-\\sqrt{3})}{x+\\sqrt{3}}=x-\\sqrt{3}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "730",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "730. 求下列各数的平方：",
        "$\\sqrt{25}$，$\\sqrt{81}$，$\\sqrt{2}$，$\\sqrt{3}$，$-\\sqrt{4}$，$\\sqrt{5}$，$-\\sqrt{6}$，",
        "$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{2}}$，$-\\sqrt{1.3}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "731",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "731. 求下列各式的值：",
        "а) $(\\sqrt{7})^2$；　б) $\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\sqrt{3}$；　в) $(-\\sqrt{26})^2$；",
        "г) $-\\sqrt{14}\\cdot\\sqrt{14}$；　д) $(3\\sqrt{5})^2$；　е) $10\\sqrt{2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}$；",
        "ж) $(0.5\\sqrt{8})^2$；　з) $(-2\\sqrt{15})^2$；　и) $\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)^2$；",
        "к) $\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{6}}\\right)^2$；　л) $\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{3}}\\right)^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "732",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "732. 把给定的下列各数（或式）写成平方的形式：",
        "а) $9$；　б) $64$；　в) $6$；　г) $10$；",
        "д) $2.5$；　е) $0.25$；　ж) $a$（$a>0$）； з) $4b$（$b>0$）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "733",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "733. 化简：",
        "а) $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}}$；　б) $-\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{5}}$；　в) $\\frac{10}{3\\sqrt{10}}$；"
      ]
    },
